  "notes": "Used for systemic or institutional protection of rights and safety.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{社会|しゃかい}{保障|ほしょう} (social security)\n・{安全|あんぜん}{保障|ほしょう} (national security)\n・{生活|せいかつ}{保障|ほしょう} (livelihood security)\n・{人権|じんけん}の{保障|ほしょう} (guarantee of human rights)\n・{保障|ほしょう}{制度|せいど} (security system)\n\nHOMOPHONES (all ほしょう):\n・{保証|ほしょう} - guarantee (for products, promises)\n・{保障|ほしょう} - security, protection (for rights, systems)\n・{補償|ほしょう} - compensation (for damages)\n\nMEMORY TIP:\n{保障|ほしょう} uses {障|しょう} (hinder/barrier) - protecting against threats",
